WEBVTT

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:09.750
Are you sure?

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.150
Change of plans.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.950
(BONNIE'S MOM GASPING)

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:29.070
OFFICER: (ON SPEAKERS)
Pull over.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.550
I can't! This is a rental!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.110
I don't know what's happening!

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:34.590
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.990
(SOBBING)

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:45.110
I'm so nervous.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.790
-What if she doesn't like me?
-Gabby.

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:48.950
I don't know if I can do this.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.550
Gabby,
it's just like you said.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.030
This is the most noble thing
a toy can do.

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:01.190
BO PEEP: Okay.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:04.070
Just edge yourself
a bit into the light.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:08.550
(STAMMERS) Not too far.

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:10.310
That's it.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:12.830
Perfect.

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:16.110
-Winner, winner...
-Chicken dinner.

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:29.950
(SNIFFLING)

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.470
LOST GIRL: Are you lost, too?

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:46.550
VOICE BOX: I'm Gabby Gabby.
Will you be my friend?

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.630
I'll help you. (SNIFFLES)

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:00.150
Excuse me, can you...
Can you help us?

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.670
Oh, honey, what's wrong?

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.550
I can't find my mom and dad.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:05.430
It's okay.
I'll help you find them.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:06.870
I'm sure they're not far.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:08.150
LOST GIRL'S DAD:
She was right next to us.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:09.790
LOST GIRL'S MOM:
She was right here!

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:11.350
LOST GIRL'S DAD: And I looked
away for one second.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.710
LOST GIRL: Mommy!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.990
I couldn't find you...

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.390
and then I found this doll.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.550
You did?

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:25.990
Her name is Gabby Gabby.

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:40.910
Whoa. We actually did that.

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:43.590
-Oh, yeah. Yes!
-(ALL LAUGHING)

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.470
GIGGLE: That was amazing.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.510
We make a great team, guys.

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.230
(POLICE SIREN CHIRPS)

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.950
OFFICER: (ON SPEAKERS)
Pull over now!

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.630
-(GASPS)
-(EXCLAIMING)

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.310
Almost there.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.270
-Stop!
-Stop!

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.150
(BONNIE YAWNS)

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:04.670
Are we home?

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.550
-(KNOCKS ON WINDOW)
-Huh?

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:10.830
Sir, will you please
step out of the vehicle?

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.510
Dad's totally going to jail.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:15.430
(INDISTINCT POLICE RADIO
CHATTER)

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.550
(CLATTERS)

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:21.470
Everyone, topside.
Let's move.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.230
Forky, I've got a very
important job for you.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.070
(GASPS) For me?

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.310
BONNIE'S DAD:
Have a good night.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.790
-(CLICKING)
-What the...?

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.870
You've gotta be kidding me.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:36.110
(CLICKING)

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.830
(FORKY CHUCKLING)

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:50.510
BUNNY: Hey.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:54.270
Um... So long, cowboy.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.750
Happy trails.

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:57.430
-(CLINKING)
-(WOODY GRUNTS)

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.590
(SHEEP BLEATS)

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:04.870
Billy, Goat, Gruff.
Take care of her, girls.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.190
(BOTH STAMMER)

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:13.910
I'm glad
I got to see you again.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.110
I... I don't...

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.230
Goodbye, Bo.

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:12.110
Buzz, I... I...

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.670
She'll be okay.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.470
Bonnie will be okay.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.030
You sure?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:31.750
Hey.
Listen to your inner voice.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.230
-HAMM: (GASPS) Bo?
-(TOYS MURMURING)

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:04.390
HAMM: Is it really her?

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:05.910
SLINKY: I'll be danged,
it's Bo!

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:07.670
Jessie.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:09.350
Bo!

